Error [jet.MoveWithoutMarker]: Implicit clone of `x`
  --> tests/ui/implicit_take_keeps_mark.jet:19:10
    |
 19 |     sink(x)
    |          ^
 Why: `sink` expects to take ownership of this value
 Fix: Write the move marker `^` (`^x`) if this is the last use, or copy first with `x.copy()`
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0209

